[{"client_msg_id":"79cc246b-464a-4fb9-b2fe-c0d9c19168bc","type":"message","user":"U771W8C56","text":"Python3.10のリリースまでにmypyが追従してくれるのに期待って感じですかねー","ts":"1626879409.229700","edited":{"user":"U771W8C56","ts":"1626879441.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XOt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7345947e-832a-4d01-b862-193ed6c5b667","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://stackoverflow.com/a/68290080\u003e\nへーーこういう風に書けるようになるんですね(ただし mypy はまだ未対応みたい)","ts":"1626878752.229400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Stack Overflow: Python 3 type hinting for decorator","id":1,"title":"Python 3 type hinting for decorator","title_link":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/68290080","text":"Considere the following code: from typing import Callable, Any TFunc = Callable[..., Any] def get_authenticated_user(): return \"John\" def require_auth() -\u0026gt; Callable[TFunc, TFunc]: def","thumb_url":"https://cdn.sstatic.net/Sites/stackoverflow/Img/apple-touch-icon@2.png?v=73d79a89bded","blocks":null,"service_name":"Stack Overflow","service_icon":"https://cdn.sstatic.net/Sites/stackoverflow/Img/apple-touch-icon.png?v=c78bd457575a","thumb_width":316,"thumb_height":316,"from_url":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/68290080","original_url":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/68290080"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5W3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79873648-22c8-4890-9b5f-7ced16bc17c2","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ジェネリクスまったくわかってないんですが、そうなんです?","ts":"1626868044.228900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1m1AG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd632652-ff47-4848-ad24-2b489b14d741","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"勘で言ってますw","ts":"1626868034.228600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L79ML"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5878fd22-fc1c-4ccd-a161-f94cb53ffa9f","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ジェネリクスで受ける的な？","ts":"1626868018.228100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hme"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01242e54-7e33-45a4-a30e-08928f4eaef6","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"だめですね","ts":"1626868014.228000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NQo=F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3f7d0c2-43e2-48bc-a3f0-4caaa3b9d711","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"あ、`f.__anotation__` を直接弄ればいいか?","ts":"1626867864.227600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"++aMu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6de619d0-2819-4b33-ab3e-9c3e44f38c2e","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"似たような役割持つ関数を沢山定義する時に型ヒントをデコレータで受け持てたらいいなと思ったんですよね。","ts":"1626867844.227100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kdc5H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27657d40-b0f1-4678-9464-9ac98f9ee745","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"推論してほしいですけども。","ts":"1626867747.226200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0BsMs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"214f2402-3ada-4e21-a8a0-c74b513a5407","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"`def f(x: int):` じゃダメなんでしょうか？","ts":"1626867738.225900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Wv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23099f81-3f9d-464e-918c-05bbf6b68ea0","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"引数はチェックできるけど、返り値はだめみたいです。int + strはだめなはずなのにmypy通ってしまう。。。むずかしいですね。\n```from typing import Callable\n\n\ndef decorator(untyped: Callable[[int], int]) -\u0026gt; Callable[[int], int]:\n    def typed(x: int) -\u0026gt; int:\n        return untyped(x)\n    return typed\n\n@decorator\ndef f(x):  # type: ignore\n    return x + 'a'```","ts":"1626867463.225300","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1626867473.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uHJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e4df6ba-7495-4f36-8318-18dc4f856db3","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"デコレータ使って型ヒントのテンプレート化できないかなーと思ったらできたことを報告します。\nちゃんと不正な型の引数与えるとmypyが叱ってくれます。\n尚、デコレータ適用対象に `# type: ignore` のコメントが必要な模様。\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1417776524061679617\u003e","ts":"1626859351.223600","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Atsushi776|@Atsushi776\u003e: お、でけた。デコレート対象の関数に type: ignore とコメントが必要なのがカッコわるい。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E6z0H3MVUAg_31U.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"atusy","author_subname":"@Atsushi776","author_link":"https://twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1417776524061679617","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/737129240/P7502_normal.jpg","text":"お、でけた。デコレート対象の関数に type: ignore とコメントが必要なのがカッコわるい。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E6z0H3MVUAg_31U.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E6z0H3MVUAg_31U.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1626859239,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1417776524061679617","original_url":"https://twitter.com/Atsushi776/status/1417776524061679617"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":2,"users":["U771W8C56","U022PB40WAF"]},{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B=QE"}]}]
